              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">POLAHAKU 48 in. Cat Wheel</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Value at full size</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">48 in. with lock and low entry, about $80</td></tr>
