            self-powered wheels: there is no motorised cat treadmill on this page, and we would not
            recommend one.
          </p>
          <p>
            Weigh your cat and measure it from nose to the base of the tail before you read the
            cards. Those two numbers, plus the floor space you have, decide the size.
          </p>
